1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:03,990
(Sheldon:)Did he mean
as if she'd been out in the sun,

2
00:00:03,990 --> 00:00:07,560
(Sheldon:)tending an herb garden without
wearing a hat or sunblock?

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,900
(Dr. Brian Greene:)No.

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:15,100
(Leonard:)That's not what he meant.

5
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:18,070
(Sheldon:)Well, we may never know.

6
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:19,210
(Sheldon:)As my mother would say,

7
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:23,080
(Sheldon:)the Asians are
an inscrutable folk.

8
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:27,580
(Sheldon:)Now, if you'll excuse me,
I have work to do.

9
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:30,120
(Leonard:)Yeah, you do.
You dog, you.

10
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:38,090
(Sheldon:)Did you get that?

11
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:40,190
(Amy(on webcam):)Every word.

12
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:43,360
(Amy(on webcam):)Our false gossip meme appears
to have reached node lambda.

13
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:44,460
(Sheldon:)This is moving faster
than we thought.

14
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:45,430
(Sheldon:)Agreed.

15
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,530
(Amy:)It appears the rate

16
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:47,700
(Amy:)of gossip transmission

17
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:49,770
(Amy:)is proportional
to the number of nodes squared.

18
00:00:49,770 --> 00:00:52,370
(Sheldon:)I must say, Amy,

19
00:00:52,370 --> 00:00:54,310
(Sheldon:)pretending
to have intercourse with you

20
00:00:54,310 --> 00:00:58,240
(Sheldon:)is giving me
a great deal of satisfaction.

21
00:00:58,250 --> 00:01:04,020
(Amy:)Slow down, Sheldon.
I'm not quite there yet.

